Read `AGENTS.md` before writing code. Locked:

- All inference local. No Brave Search, web fetch, or cloud APIs in the runtime path.
- Stack is OpenClaw + OpenShell + NemoClaw. Harness is OpenClaw (scheduling).
- Depend on predictive-maintenance-mcp for DSP. Do not rebuild FFT/envelope/bearing math.
- Exclude PMMCP `data/` (CC BY-NC-SA). Attack its scope, never its credibility.
- Not a chatbot. Always-on cron/heartbeat. Every claim cites a real artifact.
- No ISO 20816 zone claims on a benchtop fan (15 kW floor). No market-whitespace claims.
- Pitch leads with IEC 62443 + CISA Dec 2025, not TCO.
- Design for MoE + long context + per-asset fan-out. No dense ≥32B. No ASR.
- Containment closer is the product: OpenShell deny+log on exfil.
